wer\"></span>. Thus, <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"a, over b \"></span> is <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"7 over 6\"></span>. Note that 7/6, 1.166, and 1.167 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959631,"updateDate":1691007959631,"correct_answer_extracted_from_rationale":true}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959631, 1691007959631),
