<p style="text-align: left;">If the given function <math alttext="g"><mi>g</mi>
</math> is graphed in the <em>xy</em>-plane, where <math alttext="y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, what is the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"995aa663-3e15-46ac-82aa-81afafc3d606","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 11 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"147dbc30-ccad-41f8-bb3a-af8e38e20a4d","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 132 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>132</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"cbe68546-25f0-4a21-a471-d3ffd3e1cc1b","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"},{"id":"a0154ce5-20b4-49a9-9bd1-4e481fc02686","content":"<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 12 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["995aa663-3e15-46ac-82aa-81afafc3d606"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice A is correct. The <em>x</em>-coordinate of any <em>y</em>-intercept of a graph is <math alttext="0"><mn>0</mn>
</math>. Substituting <math alttext="0"><mn>0</mn>
</math> for <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
